<section class="about-page-hero">
    <div class="container site-container">
        <span class="eyebrow">About Us</span>
        <h1>About Sonagra &amp; Company</h1>
        <p>Corporate, legal and compliance advisory built on trust, confidentiality and client satisfaction.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-space about-story-section">
    <div class="container site-container">
        <div class="row align-items-center gy-5">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="about-image-frame">
                    <img src="~/images/sonagra-office-meeting.png" alt="Sonagra and Company professional business meeting" />
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-5 offset-lg-1">
                <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Our story</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">From Company Secretarial practice to a multi-disciplinary advisory firm</h2>
                <p class="lead-copy">Sonagra &amp; Company began as a Company Secretarial practice and has grown into a multi-disciplinary professional services firm covering corporate, legal and compliance advisory.</p>
                <p>Our growth rests on trust, confidentiality and client satisfaction. The word “Secretary” shares its root with “Secret” – a reminder that confidentiality and integrity are at the heart of everything we do.</p>
                <p>Over time, we have added specialised legal consultancy, regulatory advisory, transaction support and governance structuring for clients across many industries.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="about-highlight-section section-space-sm">
    <div class="container site-container">
        <div class="row gy-4">
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Growing with our clients</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Advice that evolves with your business</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-7 offset-lg-1">
                <p>As our clients have grown, so has our range of services – from legal consultancy and regulatory strategy to transaction support and corporate governance advisory.</p>
                <p>Our team brings together Company Secretaries, Chartered Accountants and Legal Experts, each with their own area of specialisation, so that every requirement is handled by the right professional.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-space about-capabilities-section">
    <div class="container site-container">
        <div class="text-center about-section-heading">
            <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">What we do</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">End-to-end support, from incorporation to representation</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-4"><article class="about-value-card"><span>01</span><h3>End-to-end services</h3><p>Incorporation, legal structuring, regulatory filings, due diligence, secretarial audits and representation before authorities.</p></article></div>
            <div class="col-md-4"><article class="about-value-card"><span>02</span><h3>Timely compliance</h3><p>Compliance should be complete and on time, since delays add risk and complexity to a business.</p></article></div>
            <div class="col-md-4"><article class="about-value-card"><span>03</span><h3>Tailored support</h3><p>Customised guidance for everyone from startups to large companies listed on a stock exchange.</p></article></div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-center mt-4 mb-0 about-beyond-note">Our work goes beyond compliance – it aims to strengthen governance, strategic clarity and long-term business value.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-space about-policies-section">
    <div class="container site-container">
        <div class="text-center about-section-heading">
            <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Ethics &amp; compliance</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Policies &amp; Professional Commitments</h2>
            <p>We commit to high standards of professional ethics, integrity, confidentiality and regulatory compliance. Our policies cover a safe and respectful workplace, the prevention of bribery and unethical practices, and the protection of confidential client information. Team members are expected to follow these principles in their dealings with clients, colleagues and other stakeholders.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-4">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <article class="about-value-card">
                    <span>01</span>
                    <h3>Confidentiality, Non-Disclosure &amp; Insider Trading Undertaking</h3>
                    <p>Our team signs a formal undertaking to protect confidential information, client records and sensitive business data, covering non-disclosure, data security and compliance with rules on unpublished price sensitive information (UPSI) and insider trading.</p>
                    <a class="text-link" href="~/docs/Confidentiality-and-Non-Disclosure-Undertaking.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Undertaking <span>↗</span></a>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <article class="about-value-card">
                    <span>02</span>
                    <h3>Prevention of Sexual Harassment (POSH) Policy</h3>
                    <p>We are committed to a safe, respectful and inclusive workplace and address concerns under applicable law, including the Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal) Act, 2013.</p>
                    <a class="text-link" href="~/docs/POSH-Policy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Policy <span>↗</span></a>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <article class="about-value-card">
                    <span>03</span>
                    <h3>Anti-Bribery &amp; Anti-Corruption (ABAC) Policy</h3>
                    <p>We conduct our activities with honesty, transparency and integrity. We do not tolerate bribery, corruption or improper inducements, and our team is expected to comply with all applicable laws.</p>
                    <a class="text-link" href="~/docs/ABAC-Policy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Policy <span>↗</span></a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

